{"data":{"allAboutMarkdown":{"sections":[{"frontmatter":{"imageAlt":"PIc","imageSrc":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/c17d9/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg","srcSet":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/a7b40/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 100w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/07d45/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 200w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/c17d9/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 400w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/a606a/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/ed451/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 100w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/d1e01/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 200w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/eb7a8/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 400w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/b5180/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":441}}}},"html":"<p>Hi, I'm a software engineer with a strong interest in technology, science, and building creative solutions to real-world problems. My experience spans mobile, embedded, and full-stack development.</p>\n<p>I earned my Computer Systems Technology diploma (AI/ML option) from BCIT in 2023.</p>\n<p>I spent just under three years at <a href=\"https://www.picotera.co/\">picoTera Electronics</a>, working on mobile and embedded systems, starting as a co-op student and continuing as a full-time engineer after graduation.</p>\n<p>I'm currently pursuing a Bachelor of Computing Science with a focus on network security, with an expected graduation in May 2027.</p>\n<p>Outside of work and school, I've been deeply focused on personal projects, such as <a href=\"https://www.singwithme.app/\">SingWithMe</a> and <a href=\"https://sepzie.github.io/SezoAudioEngine/\">Sezo Audio Engine</a>.</p>"}]}}}